      "Signal 3 — AI-DD + Foundation-Model Release + Protein-Ligand Generative Design + Boltz Ecosystem / boltzgen/boltzgen-1 [protein-ligand generative-design foundation model]: boltzgen/boltzgen-1 (Hugging Face, score 479,193 downloads + 6 likes, ts 2026-09-14 = 1 day ago, paired with OneScience-Group/BoltzGen [10 downloads, derivative]) is the FRESHEST NOVEL open-weight protein-ligand generative-design foundation model in the entire 2026-09-15 intel.jsonl and the FIRST protein-design foundation-model release in the Boltz ecosystem since the Boltz-2 update on Hugging Face. It is a direct AI-DD + foundation-model-release + structure-based-drug-design + protein-ligand-co-folding input for the BB AI-DD + biotech-infrastructure lane, distinct from id:95 Boltz-1 trunk-diffusion mechanistic-interpretability paper by deliverable (foundation-model-release vs mechanistic-interpretability-analysis), from id:95 Biomni-R0-32B-Preview by model-class (protein-ligand-generative-design vs agentic-bio-AI-foundation-model), and from id:94 Procedural Graphs by mechanism (denoising-diffusion-protein-ligand-co-folding vs procedural-graph-LLM-agent-architecture). BoltzGen-1 is the generative-design companion to Boltz-1 (the open-weights protein-structure-prediction foundation model, Boltz-Community/Boltz-1 + Boltz-Community/Boltz-2 are the canonical Boltz releases), completing the protein-structure-prediction-to-protein-ligand-generation pipeline in the open-weights-domain. The 479,193-downloads-in-the-intel-window indicates a breakout reception comparable to Boltz-1's own initial release in late-2024 and Chai-1's release in mid-2025 — a clear signal that the AI-DD community has been waiting for an open-weights generative-design model that complements the protein-structure-prediction-models. The model is positioned to compete with (or complement) RoseTTAFold-AllAtom, RFdiffusion, Chroma, Genie2, FrameDiff, and the closed-weights AlphaFold3-generative-mode for ligand-conditioned-protein-design and small-molecule-generation tasks.",
      "Four-axis score — peptide 4/5 (BoltzGen-1 enables peptide-design as a downstream-application, alongside small-molecule-generation and protein-ligand-co-folding; the model can be fine-tuned for peptide-structure-prediction-and-design); AI-agent infrastructure 5/5 (BoltzGen-1 IS the canonical foundation-layer input for AI-DD target-nomination AND for AI-agent design of structure-based-drug-design-pipelines, virtual-screening-pipelines, and lead-optimization-pipelines); longevity 4/5 (protein-ligand-co-folding has direct longevity-implications via accelerating drug-discovery for age-related-diseases; boltzgen-1 enables BB to build target-to-hit-to-lead-pipelines for aging-targets); cost 5/5 (open-weights + Hugging Face deployment + standard PyTorch + NVIDIA CUDA + vLLM-equivalent-inference-stack enables self-hosted-deployment at modest-cost). The signal is actionable from the BB AI-DD + biotech-infrastructure service stack as a BoltzGen-1 + protein-ligand-generative-design + self-hosted-deployment + AI-DD-pipeline-integration brief.",
